+/* An online free-roam session, by the game's own test: the network manager's session
+ * (+0xd0) is set and +0xa8 is clear (0x899261 hides the speed-trap tutorial with it).
+ * in_network_session() reads the race connectivity (0xa2c920: +0x38 == 1) and counts a
+ * missing manager as networked, so it cannot tell an online session while entities load. */
+static int in_online_session(void) {
